{"unit_id":"tag:09X1:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为 Hausdorff 且局部拟紧（quasi-compact）的空间（space），换言之，为对象（object），属于 <MATH_0002> 的。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若 <MATH_0003> 为同构（isomorphism），位于 <MATH_0004> 中，则 <MATH_0005> 为 qc 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若 <MATH_0006> 为 qc 覆盖（covering），且对每个 <MATH_0007>，有 qc 覆盖（covering）<MATH_0008>，则 <MATH_0009> 为 qc 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若 <MATH_0010> 为 qc 覆盖（covering），且 <MATH_0011> 为态射（morphism），属于 <MATH_0012> 的，则 <MATH_0013> 为 qc 覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":["Hausdorff","qc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"space","target_term":"空间"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"由 locally 限定的空间性质"},{"source_term":"space","target_term":"空间","context":"Hausdorff 局部拟紧空间"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"该空间范畴中的对象"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"空间范畴中的同构"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"六处 qc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"基变换态射"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09X1:proof","translation":"第 (1) 项由上文关于开（open）覆盖（coverings）是 qc 覆盖（coverings）的说明成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n第 (2) 项的证明。设 <MATH_0001>。选取 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003>，后者为拟紧（quasi-compact）的，使得 <MATH_0004> 为 <MATH_0005> 的邻域（neighbourhood）。对每个 <MATH_0006>，可以找到有限（finite）子集（subset）<MATH_0007> 以及拟紧（quasi-compact）的 <MATH_0008>、<MATH_0009>，使得 <MATH_0010> 为 <MATH_0011> 的邻域（neighbourhood）。由于 <MATH_0012> 为拟紧（quasi-compact）的，可以找到有限（finite）的一族 <MATH_0013>，使得\n<MATH_0014>。\n于是可知\n<MATH_0015>\n为 <MATH_0016> 的邻域（neighbourhood）。\n\n<STRUCT_0003><STRUCT_0004>\n第 (3) 项的证明。设 <MATH_0017> 为点（point）。设 <MATH_0018> 为其像（image）。选取 <MATH_0019> 和拟紧（quasi-compact）的子集（subsets）<MATH_0020>，使得 <MATH_0021> 为 <MATH_0022> 的邻域（neighbourhood）。选取拟紧（quasi-compact）的邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0023>，对应于 <MATH_0024> 的，映入（maps）拟紧（quasi-compact）的邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0025>，对应于 <MATH_0026> 的。则 <MATH_0027> 是拟紧（quasi-compact）子集（subset），且 <MATH_0028> 为像（image），对应于映射（map）<MATH_0029>。因此，基变换（base change）是 qc 覆盖（covering），证明完成。\n","allowed_english":["qc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"开覆盖的限定"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"开覆盖与 qc 覆盖"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"子集和邻域的性质"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域","context":"覆盖像和拟紧邻域"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"有限子集和有限一族"},{"source_term":"subset","target_term":"子集","context":"指标子集或拟紧子集"},{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点","context":"基变换空间中的点"},{"source_term":"image","target_term":"像","context":"点的像及映射的像"},{"source_term":"subsets","target_term":"子集","context":"覆盖条件选取的子集"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入","context":"邻域映入另一邻域"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"基变换映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"qc 覆盖的基变换"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"基变换后得到的 qc 覆盖"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09WY:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n由于所有对象（objects），属于 <MATH_0001> 的，都是 Hausdorff 的，任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>，属于 <MATH_0003> 的，都是分离（separated）的连续（continuous）映射（map），在拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间。因此 <MATH_0004> 为固有（proper）映射（map），在拓扑空间（topological spaces）之间，当且仅当 <MATH_0005> 为普遍闭（universally closed）的。见《拓扑（Topology）》第 <REF_0001> 节的讨论。\n\n","allowed_english":["Hausdorff"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"空间范畴中的对象"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"空间范畴的态射"},{"source_term":"separated","target_term":"分离","context":"连续映射的分离性"},{"source_term":"continuous","target_term":"连续","context":"拓扑空间间的映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"连续映射和固有映射"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"映射的两端"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"拓扑映射的 proper 性质，待术语核定"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭","context":"任意基变换后为闭映射"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节标题"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09X5:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为态射（morphism），属于 <MATH_0002> 的。若 <MATH_0003> 为固有（proper）且满射（surjective）的，则 <MATH_0004> 为 qc 覆盖（covering）。\n","allowed_english":["qc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"空间范畴中的态射"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"拓扑映射的 proper 性质"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"映射的满射性"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"固有满射给出的 qc 覆盖"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09X5:proof","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为点（point）。对每个 <MATH_0002>，选取拟紧（quasi-compact）的邻域（neighbourhood）<MATH_0003>。选取 <MATH_0004> 为开（open）的。由于 <MATH_0005> 为固有（proper）的，纤维（fibre）<MATH_0006> 为拟紧（quasi-compact）的，可以找到 <MATH_0007>，使得 <MATH_0008>。断言 <MATH_0009> 为 <MATH_0010> 的邻域（neighbourhood）。具体而言，由于 <MATH_0011> 为闭（closed）的（《拓扑（Topology）》定理 <REF_0001>），可见 <MATH_0012> 是 <MATH_0013> 的闭子集（closed subset），不包含 <MATH_0014>。由于 <MATH_0015> 为满射（surjective）的，可见 <MATH_0016> 包含于 <MATH_0017>，如所需。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"point","target_term":"点","context":"目标空间中的点"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧","context":"邻域和纤维的拟紧性"},{"source_term":"neighbourhood","target_term":"邻域","context":"点的邻域"},{"source_term":"open","target_term":"开","context":"选取的开子集"},{"source_term":"proper","target_term":"固有","context":"拓扑映射的 proper 性质"},{"source_term":"fibre","target_term":"纤维","context":"点上的纤维"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭","context":"映射为闭映射"},{"source_term":"Topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"引用章节标题"},{"source_term":"closed subset","target_term":"闭子集","context":"不含目标点的闭子集"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"映射的满射性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:09WY:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n除了一些集合（set）论问题之外，引理 <REF_0001> 表明 <MATH_0001>，配以 qc 覆盖（coverings）所成的一族，构成位点（site）。将此位点（site）（作适当修改以克服集合（set）论问题后）记为\n<MATH_0002>。\n\n","allowed_english":["qc"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"集合论规模问题的复合限定"},{"source_term":"coverings","target_term":"覆盖","context":"qc 覆盖所成的一族"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"空间范畴赋予 qc 拓扑后的位点"}],"notes":[]}
